.Dd November 9, 2026
.Dt INTEL-GPU-TOOLS 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm intel-gpu-tools
.Nd inspect and exercise GPU devices
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The intel-gpu-tools package installs DRM diagnostic and measurement programs.
The tools inspect PCI devices, decode registers and firmware, collect performance data and exercise display paths.
They require the corresponding DRM driver and access to its device nodes.
.Nm intel_gpu_top
shows engine use;
.Nm intel_reg
reads or writes device registers;
.Nm intel_vbt_decode
reads the Video BIOS Table.
Each tool has its own arguments.
IGT's tests are not in the package; the x86-64 GNU root has them, built from the same source, and
.Xr igt_runner 1
runs them.
